An educational reader companion

The TAOAM Book Companion helps readers explore mathematical concepts, notation, theorems, methods, and relationships. It is an educational aid. It is not a substitute for checking definitions, hypotheses, calculations, proofs, or original references.

The Companion is published by Ouviaj LLC. ChatGPT and the platforms on which it runs are operated separately by their providers.

Access and host-platform terms

Using the Companion in ChatGPT requires access permitted by OpenAI and any rules that apply to your account or workspace. The host platform controls sign-in, supported features, usage limits, and any platform charges. Its terms, including the applicable OpenAI terms, apply separately.

Access to the plugin does not include a purchase or download of the Atlas volumes, and does not by itself unlock protected Topic Guides. Book purchases and any separately licensed materials remain subject to their own terms.

